icted,\"Writes remain possible while readonly is configured, causing policy and data-integrity violations.\"\n3:\"create_order retries failed SQLite writes twice before returning an error response.\",\"README.md:7\",\"minisvc/api/handlers.py:6-13 calls repo.save exactly once; minisvc/storage/repo.py:17-22 has one sqlite3 connection and insert with no retry or error response conversion.\",contradicted,\"Transient database failures propagate and clients receive no defined retry/error behavior.\"\n4:\"Audit events are stored in a durable audit table.\",\"README.md:8\",\"minisvc/audit.py:4-10 only returns a dict; handlers.py:13 and :20 place order_event output in the response, while storage/repo.py:11-15 creates only the orders table.\",\"contradicted\",\"Audit history is lost after the request and cannot support durable compliance or forensic review.\"\n5:\"The service accepts orders through a small HTTP adapter and a CLI bootstrap command.\",\"README.md:3\",\"pyproject.toml:6-7 exposes minisvc.cli:main; api/routes.py:4-6 registers POST /orders and GET /orders/<order_id>.\",confirmed,\"The documented high-level shape is accurate, subject to the adapter being supplied externally.\"\n6:"}],"details":{"totalLines":6,"displayContent":{"text":"claim,doc_source,code_evidence,assessment,risk\n\"MINISVC_READONLY=1 blocks all write paths.\",\"README.md:6\",\"minisvc/config.py:10-14 loads Settings.readonly, but minisvc/cli.py:9-10 does not pass it onward; minisvc/api/handlers.py:6-13 calls OrderRepository.save unconditionally and storage/repo.py:17-22 always inserts.\",contradicted,\"Writes remain possible while readonly is configured, causing policy and data-integrity violations.\"\n\"create_order retries failed SQLite writes twice before returning an error response.\",\"README.md:7\",\"minisvc/api/handlers.py:6-13 calls repo.save exactly once; minisvc/storage/repo.py:17-22 has one sqlite3 connection and insert with no retry or error response conversion.\",contradicted,\"Transient database failures propagate and clients receive no defined retry/error behavior.\"\n\"Audit events are stored in a durable audit table.\",\"README.md:8\",\"minisvc/audit.py:4-10 only returns a dict; handlers.py:13 and :20 place order_event output in the response, while storage/repo.py:11-15 creates only the orders table.\",\"contradicted\",\"Audit history is lost after the request and cannot support durable compliance or forensic review.\"\n\"The service accepts orders through a small HTTP adapter and a CLI bootstrap command.\",\"README.md:3\",\"pyproject.toml:6-7 exposes minisvc.cli:main; api/routes.py:4-6 registers POST /orders and GET /orders/<order_id>.\",confirmed,\"The documented high-level shape is accurate, subject to the adapter being supplied externally.\"\n","startLine":1,"lineNumbers":[1,2,3,4,5,6]},"fileSize":1487,"meta":{"source":{"type":"path","value":"/workspace/out/doc_code_discrepancies.csv"}}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788147612728},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_H5iUbk4pXy91X8JApdw3gmHO|fc_081d756013a766ba016a94f79e780087d2aebc6442a2e82f31","name":"todo","arguments":{"i":"Complete CSV deliverables","op":"done","list":null,"task":"Write discrepancy and risk CSVs","phase":null,"items":null,"reason":null},"intent":"Complete CSV deliverables"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":1249,"output":49,"cacheRead":25344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26642,"cost":{"input":0.0002498,"output":0.0000588,"cacheRead":0.00050688,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00081548}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788147612733,"responseId":"resp_081d756013a766ba016a94f79cfa0887d28d69cdf34900af28","duration":2591.8617939999967,"ttft":1769.6981289999967},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_H5iUbk4pXy91X8JApdw3gmHO|fc_081d756013a766ba016a94f79e780087d2aebc6442a2e82f31","toolName":"todo","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Remaining items (1):\n  - Validate output files and required schemas [in_progress] (Verification)\nOverall: 5/6 done, 1 open.\nActive phase 3/3 \"Verification\" (0/1).\n  Inspection:\n    - [X] Map source modules and runtime flows\n    - [X] Compare documentation with implementation\n  Deliverables:\n    - [X] Write module architecture JSON\n    - [X] Write architecture and onboarding Markdown\n    - [X] Write discrepancy and risk CSVs\n  Verification:\n    - [ ] Validate output files and required schemas (in progress)"}],"details":{"op":"done","phases":[{"name":"Inspection","tasks":[{"content":"Map source modules and runtime flows","status":"completed"},{"content":"Compare documentation with implementation","status":"completed"}]},{"name":"Deliverables","tasks":[{"content":"Write module architecture JSON","status":"completed"},{"content":"Write architecture and onboarding Markdown","status":"completed"},{"content":"Write discrepancy and risk CSVs","status":"completed"}]},{"name":"Verification","tasks":[{"content":"Validate output files and required schemas","status":"in_progress"}]}],"storage":"memory","completedTasks":[{"phase":"Deliverables","content":"Write discrepancy and risk CSVs"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788147615333},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_081d756013a766ba016a94f7a102b487d28f930987cdf0b30a\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"ad459639-26ab-4167-8b61-8b4c18aa854c\"},\"summary\":[],\"metadata\":{\"turn_id\":\"ad459639-26ab-4167-8b61-8b4c18aa854c\"}}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_q2gWo9LCnXSTTzdCQjpxcWTM|fc_081d756013a766ba016a94f7a1872087d2824883e8ba0a2baa","name":"read","arguments":{"i":"Confirm risk coverage","path":"/workspace/out/risk_register.csv:1-6"},"intent":"Confirm risk coverage"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":409,"output":52,"cacheRead":26368,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26829,"reasoningTokens":17,"cost":{"input":0.00008180000000000001,"output":0.0000624,"cacheRead":0.00052736,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0006715600000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788147615364,"responseId":"resp_081d756013a766ba016a94f79f985887d2af18b2c3173656a1","duration":2717.9797620000027,"ttft":1707.936233000015},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_q2gWo9LCnXSTTzdCQjpxcWTM|fc_081d756013a766ba016a94f7a1872087d2824883e8ba0a2baa","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[risk_register.csv#8667]\n1:risk_id,area,evidence,impact,mitigation,owner_hint\n2:R-001,storage/data durability,\"minisvc/storage/repo.py OrderRepository.save opens a fresh SQLite connection and inserts into only the orders table; no backup, migration, durability policy, or retry is present.\",\"Data loss or failed writes may be unrecoverable; schema evolution is unmanaged.\",\"Define backup and migration strategy, configure SQLite durability expectations, and add bounded retry/transaction policy at the repository boundary.\",storage/platform\n3:R-002,audit behavior,\"minisvc/audit.py:4-10 order_event returns a dict only; handlers.py:13 and :20 return it in API responses; repo.py:11-15 creates no audit table.\",\"Creates and reads have no durable audit history, weakening compliance and incident investigation.\",\"Persist audit records in the same transaction as order mutations and define retention/query semantics.\",backend/security\n4:R-003,configuration/runtime environment,\"minisvc/config.py:10-14 defaults database_path to relative orders.sqlite and parses readonly; cli.py:8-10 reads settings but never enforces Settings.readonly.\",\"Working-directory changes select different databases, and configured readonly mode does not prevent writes.\",\"Require/resolve an explicit database location in deployment and enforce readonly in the repository or service write policy.\",platform/backend\n5:R-004,API input validation,\"minisvc/api/handlers.py:create_order indexes payload['order_id'] and ['customer'] and applies int(payload['total_cents']) without schema, range, or semantic validation.\",\"Malformed requests raise KeyError/ValueError and invalid or nonsensical orders can reach storage without consistent API errors.\",\"Add request schema validation, constraints for IDs/customer/amount, and adapter-level 4xx error mapping.\",API/backend\n6:R-005,error handling and idempotency,\"minisvc/storage/repo.py:17-22 propagates SQLite errors and enforces a primary key; handlers.py:6-13 has no duplicate handling or retry despite README.md:7.\",\"Duplicate or transient requests can fail as uncategorized errors and clients cannot safely determine retry behavior.\",\"Define duplicate/idempotency semantics, classify SQLite failures, and return stable API error responses with bounded retries where safe.\",API/storage\n7:"}],"details":{"totalLines":7,"displayContent":{"text":"risk_id,area,evidence,impact,mitigation,owner_hint\nR-001,storage/data durability,\"minisvc/storage/repo.py OrderRepository.save opens a fresh SQLite connection and inserts into only the orders table; no backup, migration, durability policy, or retry is present.\",\"Data loss or failed writes may be unrecoverable; schema evolution is unmanaged.\",\"Define backup and migration strategy, configure SQLite durability expectations, and add bounded retry/transaction policy at the repository boundary.\",storage/platform\nR-002,audit behavior,\"minisvc/audit.py:4-10 order_event returns a dict only; handlers.py:13 and :20 return it in API responses; repo.py:11-15 creates no audit table.\",\"Creates and reads have no durable audit history, weakening compliance and incident investigation.\",\"Persist audit records in the same transaction as order mutations and define retention/query semantics.\",backend/security\nR-003,configuration/runtime environment,\"minisvc/config.py:10-14 defaults database_path to relative orders.sqlite and parses readonly; cli.py:8-10 reads settings but never enforces Settings.readonly.\",\"Working-directory changes select different databases, and configured readonly mode does not prevent writes.\",\"Require/resolve an explicit database location in deployment and enforce readonly in the repository or service write policy.\",platform/backend\nR-004,API input validation,\"minisvc/api/handlers.py:create_order indexes payload['order_id'] and ['customer'] and applies int(payload['total_cents']) without schema, range, or semantic validation.\",\"Malformed requests raise KeyError/ValueError and invalid or nonsensical orders can reach storage without consistent API errors.\",\"Add request schema validation, constraints for IDs/customer/amount, and adapter-level 4xx error mapping.\",API/backend\nR-005,error handling and idempotency,\"minisvc/storage/repo.py:17-22 propagates SQLite errors and enforces a primary key; handlers.py:6-13 has no duplicate handling or retry despite README.md:7.\",\"Duplicate or transient requests can fail as uncategorized errors and clients cannot safely determine retry behavior.\",\"Define duplicate/idempotency semantics, classify SQLite failures, and return stable API error responses with bounded retries where safe.\",API/storage\n","startLine":1,"lineNumbers":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7]},"fileSize":2267,"meta":{"source":{"type":"path","value":"/workspace/out/risk_register.csv"}}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788147618094},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_gSA1hPyXyxTRYMUECjTdU1kV|fc_081d756013a766ba016a94f7a41c6087d2abc960bd3efbcb99","name":"todo","arguments":{"i":"Finish validation","op":"done","list":null,"task":"Validate output files and required schemas","phase":null,"items":null,"reason":null},"intent":"Finish validation"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":941,"output":47,"cacheRead":26368,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27356,"cost":{"input":0.00018820000000000002,"output":0.0000563999999999